# Packages the showcase runner image installs from PyPI that mbt does NOT
# depend on, so uv.lock says nothing about them and cannot pin them.
#
#   jupyterlab  - the DS inner loop, notebooks/ds_inner_loop.ipynb
#   setuptools  - h2o-pysparkling imports pkg_resources at import time without
#                 declaring setuptools; the image's CPython (python-build-
#                 standalone) bundles setuptools 84, and 82 removed
#                 pkg_resources, so `import pysparkling` failed and every
#                 sparkling build with it. The docker official python image the
#                 runner used to start from bundled 79.0.1.
#
# This file is the intent; image-extras.txt beside it is the resolved closure
# and is what the image build actually reads. Regenerate after editing:
#
#   examples/showcase/scripts/lock_image_extras.sh
#
jupyterlab
setuptools<82
